{"id":"huntik:page:2451","page_id":2451,"title":"Newlife","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Newlife is a spell used by members of the Casterwill family to revive Titans that have already been defeated in battle, giving the Titans a second chance to fight.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E26_Sophie_Newlife.png","wikitext":"File:S1E26_Sophie_Newlife.png","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Yellow","wikitext":"Yellow","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Healing","wikitext":"Healing","links":[]},"users":{"text":"LeBlanche \n Sophie Casterwill \n White","wikitext":"[[LeBlanche]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[White]]","links":[{"target_title":"LeBlanche","label":"LeBlanche","target_id":"huntik:page:2057","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/LeBlanche","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2057"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"White","label":"White","target_id":"huntik:page:7985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/White","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7985"}]},"first":{"text":"\"The Mission\"","wikitext":"\"[[The Mission]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Mission","label":"The Mission","target_id":"huntik:page:4243","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mission","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4243"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E26_Sophie_Newlife.png","value_text":"File:S1E26_Sophie_Newlife.png","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Yellow","value_text":"Yellow","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Healing","value_text":"Healing","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[LeBlanche]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[White]]","value_text":"LeBlanche \n Sophie Casterwill \n White","links":[{"target_title":"LeBlanche","label":"LeBlanche","target_id":"huntik:page:2057","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/LeBlanche","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2057"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"White","label":"White","target_id":"huntik:page:7985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/White","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7985"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[The Mission]]\"","value_text":"\"The Mission\"","links":[{"target_title":"The Mission","label":"The Mission","target_id":"huntik:page:4243","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mission","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4243"}]}],"start":0,"end":187}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This spell was used by [[Sophie Casterwill]] during her lone stand against [[the Professor]] to call back [[Sabriel]] and [[Icarus]] who had been defeated prior in a battle with [[Zhalia Moon]]. {{source|The Mission}} \n\nNewlife also was used by [[White]], one of [[Nimue Casterwill]]'s guardians, to revive his [[Titan]], [[Palamedes]] in the [[Crystal Caves]] after he was defeated by [[Lok|Lok Lambert's]] [[Lindorm]]. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}\n\nOn [[Avalon]], [[LeBlanche]] used Newlife to revive Zhalia's [[King Basilisk]] and reverse his Stonegaze on [[Dante Vale]] and [[Caliban]] who had been turned to stone after [[Divine Mirror Kagami]] reflected the Basilisk' ability. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}","text":"This spell was used by Sophie Casterwill during her lone stand against the Professor to call back Sabriel and Icarus who had been defeated prior in a battle with Zhalia Moon. [The Mission] \n\nNewlife also was used by White, one of Nimue Casterwill's guardians, to revive his Titan, Palamedes in the Crystal Caves after he was defeated by Lok Lambert's Lindorm. [Cave of the Casterwills]\n\nOn Avalon, LeBlanche used Newlife to revive Zhalia's King Basilisk and reverse his Stonegaze on Dante Vale and Caliban who had been turned to stone after Divine Mirror Kagami reflected the Basilisk' ability. [Knight of the Willblade]"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall|DUT=Leefvonk|POR=Nova-vida\", \"Vida-nova}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Healing spells]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Newlife is a spell used by members of the Casterwill family to revive Titans that have already been defeated in battle, giving the Titans a second chance to fight.\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by Sophie Casterwill during her lone stand against the Professor to call back Sabriel and Icarus who had been defeated prior in a battle with Zhalia Moon. [The Mission] \n\nNewlife also was used by White, one of Nimue Casterwill's guardians, to revive his Titan, Palamedes in the Crystal Caves after he was defeated by Lok Lambert's Lindorm. [Cave of the Casterwills]\n\nOn Avalon, LeBlanche used Newlife to revive Zhalia's King Basilisk and reverse his Stonegaze on Dante Vale and Caliban who had been turned to stone after Divine Mirror Kagami reflected the Basilisk' ability. [Knight of the Willblade]\n\n== International Names ==","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E26_Sophie_Newlife.png\n| aura  = Yellow\n| class = Healing\n| users = [[LeBlanche]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[White]]\n| first = \"[[The Mission]]\"\n}}'''Newlife''' is a spell used by members of the [[Casterwill family]] to revive [[Titans]] that have already been defeated in battle, giving the Titans a second chance to fight.\n== History ==\nThis spell was used by [[Sophie Casterwill]] during her lone stand against [[the Professor]] to call back [[Sabriel]] and [[Icarus]] who had been defeated prior in a battle with [[Zhalia Moon]]. {{source|The Mission}} \n\nNewlife also was used by [[White]], one of [[Nimue Casterwill]]'s guardians, to revive his [[Titan]], [[Palamedes]] in the [[Crystal Caves]] after he was defeated by [[Lok|Lok Lambert's]] [[Lindorm]]. {{source|Cave of the Casterwills}}\n\nOn [[Avalon]], [[LeBlanche]] used Newlife to revive Zhalia's [[King Basilisk]] and reverse his Stonegaze on [[Dante Vale]] and [[Caliban]] who had been turned to stone after [[Divine Mirror Kagami]] reflected the Basilisk' ability. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}\n\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall|DUT=Leefvonk|POR=Nova-vida\", \"Vida-nova}}\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family magic]]\n[[Category:Yellow-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Healing spells]]","categories":["Casterwill family magic","Healing spells","Magic","Yellow-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_title":"LeBlanche","label":"LeBlanche","target_id":"huntik:page:2057","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/LeBlanche","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2057"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"White","label":"White","target_id":"huntik:page:7985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/White","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7985"},{"target_title":"The Mission","label":"The Mission","target_id":"huntik:page:4243","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Mission","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4243"},{"target_title":"Casterwill family","label":"Casterwill family","target_id":"huntik:page:3280","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Casterwill_family","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3280"},{"target_title":"Titans","label":"Titans","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titans","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"the Professor","label":"the Professor","target_id":"huntik:page:2053","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Professor","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2053"},{"target_title":"Sabriel","label":"Sabriel","target_id":"huntik:page:2123","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sabriel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2123"},{"target_title":"Icarus","label":"Icarus","target_id":"huntik:page:3028","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Icarus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3028"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"},{"target_title":"White","label":"White","target_id":"huntik:page:7985","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/White","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A7985"},{"target_title":"Nimue Casterwill","label":"Nimue Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:4501","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Nimue_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4501"},{"target_title":"Titan","label":"Titan","target_id":"huntik:page:2010","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titan","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_title":"Palamedes","label":"Palamedes","target_id":"huntik:page:5446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Palamedes","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A5446"},{"target_title":"Crystal Caves","label":"Crystal Caves","target_id":"huntik:page:16715","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Crystal_Caves","status":"